    {
      "id": "q",
      "kind": "q",
      "start": 0.15,
      "end": 1.543,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Could Jack have fit on that door?",
          "start": 0.15,
          "end": 1.543
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scene",
      "kind": "scene",
      "start": 2.143,
      "end": 9.772,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Rose survives on a floating piece of wood. Jack stays in the freezing water.",
          "start": 2.143,
          "end": 6.586
        },
        {
          "text": "Fans have argued about it for almost thirty years.",
          "start": 6.986,
          "end": 9.772
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "test",
      "kind": "test",
      "start": 10.372,
      "end": 17.829,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Is the door big enough for two? Probably.",
          "start": 10.372,
          "end": 12.446
        },
        {
          "text": "But size isn't the real problem. Buoyancy is. With two people on it, it starts to sink.",
          "start": 12.846,
          "end": 17.829
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "exp",
      "kind": "exp",
      "start": 18.429,
      "end": 25.891,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "In twenty twenty three, the director ran a hypothermia experiment with stunt doubles.",
          "start": 18.429,
          "end": 22.853
        },
        {
          "text": "His conclusion? Jack might have survived. Maybe.",
          "start": 23.253,
          "end": 25.891
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "kind": "end",
      "start": 26.491,
      "end": 34.334,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "So, fit or no fit? Comment below.",
          "start": 26.491,
          "end": 29.006
        },
        {
          "text": "The full story of the two hundred million dollar bet is on the channel.",
          "start": 29.406,
          "end": 32.529
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, back to that door.",
          "start": 32.929,
          "end": 34.334
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
